o you want I want  see the evidence I want to see the video  footage you want the truth yes I won't  the truth I want justice for my father  attorney Ben Crump told us witnesses  said that Bradford had been trying to  help out right before he was shot he was  waving witnesses away from the gunshots  and away from the shooting and that a  police officer then gunned him down they  also say that police officers gave no  verbal commands before opening fire the  police officer who did the shooting has  been placed on administrative leave  Rihanna AJ's mom says she wouldn't wish  that pain on her worst enemy Marc thank  you
 

